title A plugin waits for a service

deepseek "DeepSeek adapter"
store    "Context store"
loop     "Agent loop plugin" state waiting
fake     "Test adapter"

llm1 at deepseek
llm2 at fake

# The loop plugin needs llm, and the store has none, so it waits.
pause "The loop plugin lists llm in inject. Its fiber stays pending."

# The DeepSeek adapter provides llm, so the loop can start.
llm1 -> store "provide puts the service in the store and refreshes every fiber."
loop : running "Every name in inject now exists, so the fiber loads and becomes active."

# The adapter is disposed: the loop stops first, then llm leaves.
loop : waiting "Dependents unload while the service still exists, then go back to pending."
llm1 -> deepseek "The provide disposer removes llm from the store."

# A test adapter provides llm, and the same loop starts again.
llm2 -> store "A test can provide a different llm under the same name."
loop : running "The loop code did not change. It now talks to the test adapter."
